# Copy to `.env` and fill in. `.env` is gitignored; this file is not.
#
# HuggingFace access token. Only needed for gated models — pyannote's
# segmentation and diarization checkpoints require accepting their
# conditions on the model page first, then a read token here.
#
# Everything Summo ships by default (CAM++, ERes2NetV2, Silero VAD,
# the ASR models) downloads without any token at all.
#
# Create at: https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens  (scope: read)
HF_TOKEN=
